Subject: [PATCH 3/3] fill not-cca2: r2 checkpoint 1

Add the authorized private-key oracle readers (indSpec_decDom/_decRng,
indSpec_challengeDom/_challengeRng, indImpl_dec_onSpec,
indImpl_challenge_none_onSpec) to PrivateKey/OracleSecurity.lean, and prove
Composability.prfFixedScheme_not_cca2 in PrivateKey/OracleFromPRF.lean via the
general simulation lemma cca2Run and the decryption reader cca2Decrypt.

